        <reg_purpose>
          
    
      <purpose_text>
        <para>This register is provided so that software can discover the <xref linkend="#effective_frequency.aarch32">effective frequency</xref> of the system counter. It must be programmed with this value as part of system initialization. The value of the register is not interpreted by hardware.</para>
      </purpose_text>

        </reg_purpose>

